    "title": "Automating Your E-Commerce Operations: How VAs Can Manage Inventory Updates, Optimize Product Descriptions for SEO, and Moderate Customer Reviews on Shopify or Amazon",
    "excerpt": "Discover how delegating inventory management, SEO optimization, and review moderation to Philippines-based virtual assistants can streamline your e-commerce operations and scale your business.",
    "minutes": 10,
